	(text_box "Power hub v0.5 — USB-C PD in (CH224A: 9 V, then 20 V or 28 V EPR as the controller asks) = VRACK → 4 × TPS26600 eFuse (1.6 A) → 6-pin JST PH rows A–D.\nRack controller: ESP32-S3-MINI-1 on VBUS, TJA1462AT (CAN master, star bus, both terminations here), POS token per row.\nRows are OFF without firmware: SHDN is pulled low; the controller turns each row on once the PD contract is final."
